nos &#537;i posibilitatea de a vorbi cu operatorul dac&#259; e nevoie.</p><p>La <strong>ie&#537;ire (Exit Point)</strong>, &#537;oferul scaneaz&#259; biletul, sistemul calculeaz&#259; automat taxa (dac&#259; e cazul), iar bariera se deschide doar dup&#259; validare.</p><p>Ambele terminale sunt <strong>rezistente la exterior</strong>, func&#539;ioneaz&#259; &icirc;n orice vreme &#537;i se configureaz&#259; u&#537;or prin internet.</p><p> Ideale pentru parc&#259;ri de mall-uri, spitale, blocuri, fabrici sau depozite &ndash; <strong>f&#259;r&#259; cozi, f&#259;r&#259; personal la poart&#259;, cu control total</strong>.</p>", "parent": "6220babb2cab9a0032d29007", "id": "690b56ecc513c100313e03d9", "icon": "public/product-categories/icon/4c1efe65-42ba-4302-b7bd-06e99a15dac8.svg"}, "etichete-termice": {"title": "Etichete termice", "slug": "etichete-termice", "description": "<p>Eticheta termica</p>", "parent": "5d2e5b3af8bdad003164db0e", "id": "5d2e5b56f8bdad003164db10", "icon": "public/product-categories/icon/4cb9ba8a-067b-4f5e-bcd9-ef3d451dd526.jpg"}, "amplificatoare-audio": {"title": "Amplificatoare audio", "slug": "amplificatoare-audio", "description": "<p>Amplificatoare</p>", "parent": "5d2e5b82f8bdad003164db16", "id": "5d2e5b96f8bdad003164db18", "icon": "public/product-categories/icon/3d150501-febb-47d1-94f7-ce134692ca73.jpg"}, "imprimante-de-etichete": {"title": "Imprimante de etichete", "slug": "imprimante-de-etichete", "description": "<p>Imprimante de etichete</p>", "parent": "5d2e5babf8bdad003164db1a", "id": "5d2e5bbbf8bdad003164db1b", "icon": "public/product-categories/icon/d231e4fd-6da1-43b8-b8bf-480784833bab.jpg"}, "turnichete-poarta": {"title": "Turnichete-poarta", "slug": "turnichete-poarta", "description": "", "parent": "5e3a75e898acc300316b96aa", "id": "5e3a784298acc300316b96af", "icon": "public/product-categories/icon/ae65e2b2-3d91-4ca8-9199-45b04c00d088.jpg"}, "scanere-de-masa": {"title": "Scanere de masa", "slug": "scanere-de-masa", "description": "", "p